@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@companyAdminEmail = admin@al-salamah.com
@companyAdminPassword = User@123456
@deputyAdminEmail = deputy@al-salamah.com
@deputyAdminPassword = User@123456

### =====================================================================
### 09. TENANT FINANCIAL POLICY, COMPANY PROFILE & BRANDING ASSETS TEST SUITE
### =====================================================================
### Covers the sovereign tenant-management endpoints added on top of TenantSettingsController:
### financial policy (VAT/margin/commission/spending ceiling), company profile
### (trade names, CR, National 700 number), and IStorageService-backed branding asset upload.
### All write endpoints are CompanyAdmin/SystemSuperAdmin-only — DeputyAdmin must get 403.

### =====================================================================
### 9.1 AUTHENTICATION & SETUP
### =====================================================================

### 9.1.1 Login as Company Admin - Expect 200 OK
# @name companyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

{
  "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{companyAdminPassword}}"
}

@companyAdminToken = {{companyAdminLogin.response.body.data.Token}}

### 9.1.2 Login as Deputy Admin (for boundary tests) - Expect 200 OK
# @name deputyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

{
  "email": "{{deputyAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{deputyAdminPassword}}"
}

@deputyAdminToken = {{deputyAdminLogin.response.body.data.Token}}

### =====================================================================
### 9.2 FINANCIAL POLICY MANAGEMENT
### =====================================================================

### 9.2.1 Get Financial Policy (CompanyAdmin) - Expect 200 OK, seeded Al-Salamah defaults
# @name getFinancialPolicy
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 9.2.2 Get Financial Policy (DeputyAdmin, read allowed) - Expect 200 OK
# @name getFinancialPolicyAsDeputy
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 9.2.3 Update Financial Policy (CompanyAdmin) - Expect 200 OK
# @name updateFinancialPolicy
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "vatPercentage": 15.00,
  "targetMinimumMarginPercentage": 27.50,
  "salesCommissionPercentage": 5.50,
  "defaultSpendingCeilingCap": 6500.00,
  "currencyCode": "SAR"
}

### 9.2.4 Update Financial Policy (DeputyAdmin) - Expect 403 Forbidden [SOVEREIGN BOUNDARY]
# @name updateFinancialPolicyAsDeputyBlocked
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "vatPercentage": 15.00,
  "targetMinimumMarginPercentage": 10.00,
  "salesCommissionPercentage": 20.00,
  "defaultSpendingCeilingCap": 999999.00,
  "currencyCode": "SAR"
}

### 9.2.5 Update Financial Policy - VAT Out of Range (>100) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name updateFinancialPolicyInvalidVat
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "vatPercentage": 150.00,
  "targetMinimumMarginPercentage": 25.00,
  "salesCommissionPercentage": 5.00,
  "defaultSpendingCeilingCap": 5000.00,
  "currencyCode": "SAR"
}

### 9.2.6 Update Financial Policy - Commission Out of Range (>50) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name updateFinancialPolicyInvalidCommission
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "vatPercentage": 15.00,
  "targetMinimumMarginPercentage": 25.00,
  "salesCommissionPercentage": 75.00,
  "defaultSpendingCeilingCap": 5000.00,
  "currencyCode": "SAR"
}

### 9.2.7 Update Financial Policy - Negative Spending Ceiling - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name updateFinancialPolicyNegativeCeiling
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "vatPercentage": 15.00,
  "targetMinimumMarginPercentage": 25.00,
  "salesCommissionPercentage": 5.00,
  "defaultSpendingCeilingCap": -100.00,
  "currencyCode": "SAR"
}

### 9.2.8 Get Financial Policy Without Token - Expect 401 Unauthorized
# @name getFinancialPolicyNoToken
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/financial-policy
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### =====================================================================
### 9.3 COMPANY PROFILE MANAGEMENT
### =====================================================================

### 9.3.1 Update Company Profile (CompanyAdmin) - Expect 200 OK
# @name updateCompanyProfile
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/company-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "companyNameAr": "شركة السلامة لحماية الحرائق المحدودة",
  "companyNameEn": "Al-Salamah Fire Protection Co. Ltd.",
  "commercialRegistrationNumber": "1012345678",
  "nationalUnifiedNumber700": "7012345678"
}

### 9.3.2 Update Company Profile (DeputyAdmin) - Expect 403 Forbidden [SOVEREIGN BOUNDARY]
# @name updateCompanyProfileAsDeputyBlocked
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/company-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyNameAr": "محاولة تعديل غير مصرح بها",
  "companyNameEn": "Unauthorized Edit Attempt",
  "commercialRegistrationNumber": "1099999999",
  "nationalUnifiedNumber700": "7099999999"
}

### 9.3.3 Update Company Profile - Invalid CR Format (not 10 digits) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name updateCompanyProfileInvalidCr
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/company-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "companyNameAr": "شركة السلامة لحماية الحرائق",
  "companyNameEn": "Al-Salamah Fire Protection Co.",
  "commercialRegistrationNumber": "123",
  "nationalUnifiedNumber700": "7012345678"
}

### 9.3.4 Update Company Profile - Missing Arabic Name - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name updateCompanyProfileMissingNameAr
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/company-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyNameAr": "",
  "companyNameEn": "Al-Salamah Fire Protection Co.",
  "commercialRegistrationNumber": "1012345678",
  "nationalUnifiedNumber700": "7012345678"
}

### =====================================================================
### 9.4 BRANDING ASSET UPLOAD (IStorageService: Local disk / AWS S3)
### =====================================================================

### 9.4.1 Upload Logo Asset (CompanyAdmin) - Expect 200 OK, returns AssetUrl
# @name uploadLogoAsset
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding/asset
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assetType"

1
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="asset"; filename="logo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Mock logo binary content for testing purposes.
------AmanixBoundary--

### 9.4.2 Upload Favicon Asset (CompanyAdmin) - Expect 200 OK
# @name uploadFaviconAsset
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding/asset
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assetType"

2
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="asset"; filename="favicon.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Mock favicon binary content for testing purposes.
------AmanixBoundary--

### 9.4.3 Apply Uploaded Logo URL to Branding - Expect 200 OK
# @name applyUploadedLogo
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "logoUrl": "{{uploadLogoAsset.response.body.data.assetUrl}}",
  "faviconUrl": "{{uploadFaviconAsset.response.body.data.assetUrl}}",
  "themeColors": { "primary": "#FF5722", "secondary": "#1976D2", "accent": "#1976D2" },
  "socialLinks": {},
  "welcomeMessage": "مرحباً بكم في شركة السلامة"
}

### 9.4.4 Fetch the Uploaded Logo via Secured Files Endpoint (Local provider only) - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}{{uploadLogoAsset.response.body.data.assetUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream

### 9.4.5 Upload Branding Asset (DeputyAdmin) - Expect 403 Forbidden [SOVEREIGN BOUNDARY]
# @name uploadAssetAsDeputyBlocked
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding/asset
Authorization: Bearer {{deputyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assetType"

1
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="asset"; filename="blocked.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Should be rejected - DeputyAdmin cannot upload branding assets.
------AmanixBoundary--

### 9.4.6 Upload Branding Asset Without Token - Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding/asset
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assetType"

1
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="asset"; filename="unauth.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Should be rejected - no auth token.
------AmanixBoundary--
